- Build: `build.cmd` (x86 MSVC; `VCVARS` may point to `vcvars32.bat`), output in `build\`.
- Self-test: `build\selftest.exe` runs without the game.
- In-game check: the log next to the DLL (`<log name>`) shows the build, the check site and the hooks.
